# API Endpoints for Listing Tokens on ICP

For your trading platform's market list, here are the relevant endpoints to discover token canisters launched on ICP:

---

## 1. ICRC API — List All ICRC Ledgers (tokens)

This is your **primary endpoint** for listing token canisters (ckBTC, SNS tokens, etc.):

```bash
# List all ICRC ledgers (v2, cursor pagination)
curl -s "https://icrc-api.internetcomputer.org/api/v2/ledgers?limit=10"

# Next page using cursor
curl -s "https://icrc-api.internetcomputer.org/api/v2/ledgers?limit=10&after=<next_cursor>"

# Get a specific ledger by canister ID (e.g. ckBTC)
curl -s "https://icrc-api.internetcomputer.org/api/v2/ledgers/mxzaz-hqaaa-aaaar-qaada-cai"
```

> **Note:** ICRC API covers ICRC-standard tokens (ckBTC, SNS tokens, TestICP, etc.) but **not mainnet ICP itself**. [[ICRC API docs](https://skills.internetcomputer.org/skills/ic-dashboard/#ic-dashboard-apis)]

---

## 2. SNS API — List SNS Tokens

For tokens launched via the SNS (Service Nervous System) launchpad:

```bash
# List all SNSes (each has its own token)
curl -s "https://sns-api.internetcomputer.org/api/v2/snses?limit=10"

# List proposals for a specific SNS
curl -s "https://sns-api.internetcomputer.org/api/v2/snses/<ROOT_CANISTER_ID>/proposals?limit=5"
```

[[SNS API](https://skills.internetcomputer.org/skills/ic-dashboard/#implementation)]

---

## 3. Ledger API — Mainnet ICP Token

For the native **ICP token** specifically:

```bash
# List ICP accounts
curl -s "https://ledger-api.internetcomputer.org/v2/accounts?limit=10"

# List ICP transactions
curl -s "https://ledger-api.internetcomputer.org/v2/transactions?limit=10"

# Total ICP supply
curl -s "https://ledger-api.internetcomputer.org/supply/total/latest"
```

[[Ledger API](https://skills.internetcomputer.org/skills/ic-dashboard/#implementation)]

