## Key Notes for Your Trading Platform

- **Use v2+ endpoints** — they support cursor-based pagination (`after`, `before`, `limit`) with `next_cursor` / `previous_cursor` in responses.
- **ICRC API** = best for listing all token ledgers on ICP.
- **SNS API** = best for tokens launched via SNS launchpad.
- **Ledger API** = use exclusively for native ICP token data.
- No authentication or canister deployment needed — all are public read-only REST APIs. [[IC Dashboard APIs](https://skills.internetcomputer.org/skills/ic-dashboard/#ic-dashboard-apis)]